  "details": "On multiple occasions, I've seen PlayerObject exhibit strange, often project-damaging behaviors in Client Sim. 20% of the time it doesn't run at all, and the other 80% when it does, it wrecks the Unity project environment so you have to recompile every time before you test even if nothing changed in Udon. This change is permanent and continues even after removing PlayerObject from the scene, which seems like that may be corrupting the Unity project.",
